      "role": "user",
      "content": "look, i get that there are risks, but an \"adapter\" means more dev time and more budget we just don't have. the client is basically saying if this isn't a direct integration, they might pull the plug on the whole phase. \n\nif we just do a quick mapping and push it through, is it really that big of a deal? like, can't we just bridge the gap manually in the code and avoid the formal middleware step to keep this on schedule? i really need to know if we can just make this work without making it a whole thing.",
